OL,3,GNEWSAMOT for hearse that carried Diana
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn auctioneer selling a piece of
OL,7,Fmemorabilia associated with the late
OL,8,FPrincess Diana said interest in such
OL,9,Fitems remained strong.
OL,11,FAnglia Car Auctions based in King's
OL,12,FLynn, Norfolk, is selling the MOT
OL,13,Fcertificate for the hearse that carried
OL,14,Fthe Princess of Wales to her final
OL,15,Fresting place at Althorp,
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire, in September 1997.
OL,18,FWilliam King, an auctioneer of 30
OL,19,Fyears, said: "There doesn't seem to be
OL,20,Fany drop off in the demand for anything
OL,21,Fthat's Diana related."
